.TH PASTEBINIT 1 "September 2026" "pastebinit 1.9.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pastebinit \- command-line pastebin client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pastebinit
.RI [ OPTION... ]
.RI [ FILE... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pastebinit
reads standard input or the specified files and submits their contents to a
configured pastebin service.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-V
Write the destination URL and Python-compatible encoded request bytes to
standard error.
.SH SECURITY
For compatibility with pastebinit 1.8.0, verbose output includes all encoded
parameters. In particular,
.B \-V \-p
writes the URL-encoded password to standard error. Do not use verbose mode
with secrets when standard error can be logged or observed.
